{
  "message": "Your final devlog reports a finished first level, but neither linked media item shows gameplay. Across these weeks, the references and design board provided starting material, while playable progress stayed unverified. The project is behind on verifiable progress: the playtest and completion reports leave the game’s actual state unknown. This evidence gap is common and can be fixed in the next checkpoint. Start there by publishing the reported level with launch instructions, so anyone can check the jump. At the next checkpoint, I look forward to your build, devlogs and testing notes ;)",
  "agreed": []
}

